                                                   470 ***********************************************************************
                                                   471 * (pending VTZ inclusion in SATK ASAM)
                                                   472 *
                                                   473 *     VTZ Macro to help build VTZ instruction
                                                   474 *        VTZ   V1,V2,i3
                                                   475 *
                                                   476 *        Note: v1 and v2 are fixed vector registers
                                                   477 *              i3 can be specified in hex eg. x'1F1F'
                                                   478 ***********************************************************************
                                                   479          MACRO
                                                   480          VTZ   &I3
                                                   481 .*                                     &I3  - i3 for VTZ instruction
                                                   482          LCLA  &V2I3
                                                   483 &V2I3    SETA  +X'200000'+(16*&I3)
